{
 "title": "if、elif、else",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "条件周围不需要括号；在末尾写 `:`，下面的行缩进 4 个空格。多种情况用 `elif` 串联；`else` 接住剩下的所有情况。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "fn main():",
    "    score = 85",
    "    if score >= 90:",
    "        print(\"Grade: A\")",
    "    elif score >= 80:",
    "        print(\"Grade: B\")",
    "    elif score >= 70:",
    "        print(\"Grade: C\")",
    "    else:",
    "        print(\"Grade: F\")"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "Grade: B"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "第一个为真的分支会运行，其余的被跳过。所以要把最大的阈值放在前面。"
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c02-l01-x1",
   "prompt": "补全这条链：`temperature` 低于 10 时输出 `Cold`，高于 25 时输出 `Hot`，其他情况输出 `Mild`。",
   "starter": [
    "fn main():",
    "    temperature = 5",
    "    if temperature < 10:",
    "        print(\"?\")",
    "    elif temperature > 25:",
    "        print(\"?\")",
    "    else:",
    "        print(\"?\")"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "fn main():",
    "    temperature = 5",
    "    if temperature < 10:",
    "        print(\"Cold\")",
    "    elif temperature > 25:",
    "        print(\"Hot\")",
    "    else:",
    "        print(\"Mild\")"
   ],
   "hint": "按顺序把三个 `?` 替换成 `Cold`、`Hot`、`Mild`。",
   "expected": [
    "Cold"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c02-l01-q1",
   "q": "如果有多个分支为真，会运行几个？",
   "options": [
    "全部",
    "只有第一个为真的",
    "只有最后一个"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "`if`/`elif` 链会在第一个为真的分支处停止。"
  }
 ]
}
